      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1912-01-06_WidnesExaminer_art0053" n="art0053">
        <head>EXAMINER Series</head>
        <p>THE EXAMINER Series</p>
        <p>OP WEEK-END NEWSPAPERS COMPRISES : II H F., WARRINGTON EXAMINER published every Saturday morning. The principal and the oldest weekly paper for War- rington, Stockton Heath, Penketh, Winwick, Padgate Lymm, &amp;c., being one of the largest and best weekly papers Lancashire and Cheshire. The district covered in 'his paper comprises a large trading and agricultural tract in South Lancashire and Mid- Cheshire. - - -</p>
