        <p>COUNTY BOROUGH OF WARRINGTON . EDUCATION COMMITTEE, HEAD MISTRESS, INFANTS' SCHOOL. Applications are invited for the post of HEAD MISTRESS of the INFANTS' DEPARTMENT of the ST. ANN'S C,E. SCHOOL. Preference will be given to teachers holding a certifi- cate of the National Froebel Union. The commencing salary will be at the rate of £lOO Per annum, rising according to scale, together with £3 in respect of the Elementary and an additional .£5 for the Higher certificate of the National Froebel Union. Applications must be made on the official form, which together with a copy of the scale of salaries, may be obtained from the undersigned, to whom they must be returned by not later than Monday, the 22nd Jan., 1912. J. MOORE MURRAY, M.Sc.. Education Office, Secretary and Director. Sanls ey St., Warrington, 3rd January, 1912.</p>
